# The DDR3 probe's variable clock: Robert Peip's MiSTerDDR3Test reconfigurable
# PLL (tools/ddr3test-ref rtl/pll), modules renamed pll_var (THIRD_PARTY.md).
# 50 MHz in, 125 MHz out, its counters rewritten at run time through pll_cfg.
set_global_assignment -name SYNTHESIS_ONLY_QIP ON
set_global_assignment -library "pll_var" -name VERILOG_FILE [file join $::quartus(qip_path) "pll_var.v"]
set_global_assignment -library "pll_var" -name VERILOG_FILE [file join $::quartus(qip_path) "pll_var/pll_var_0002.v"]
set_instance_assignment -name PLL_COMPENSATION_MODE DIRECT -to "*pll_var_0002*|altera_pll:altera_pll_i*|*"
set_instance_assignment -name UNFORCE_MERGE_PLL_OUTPUT_COUNTER ON -to "*pll_var_0002*|altera_pll:altera_pll_i*|*"
